---
---

<section id="service" class="service">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title fade-in">サービス</h2>
    <p class="section-sub fade-in">ビジネスの魅力を、しっかり届けるホームページを作ります</p>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature-card glass fade-in">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="url(#icon-grad)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><defs><linearGradient id="icon-grad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="24" y2="24"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#4ecdc4"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#5b8c6e"/></linearGradient></defs><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>最短1週間で納品</h3>
        <p>素材をいただいてから最短1週間でホームページを公開。スピーディにお届けします。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card glass fade-in">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="url(#icon-grad)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>スマホ対応</h3>
        <p>スマートフォンでもパソコンでも、きれいに表示されるレスポンシブデザイン。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card glass fade-in">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="url(#icon-grad)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>月額費用ゼロ</h3>
        <p>制作費のみ。毎月の維持費はかかりません。ドメイン代（年1,500円程度）だけ。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card glass fade-in">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="url(#icon-grad)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>更新いらずの設計</h3>
        <p>Instagramと連携して、普段の投稿がそのままサイトに反映。更新の手間ゼロ。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card glass fade-in">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="url(#icon-grad)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>お問い合わせフォーム</h3>
        <p>お客様からの問い合わせがメールで届く仕組みを設置。取りこぼしを防ぎます。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card glass fade-in">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="url(#icon-grad)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Googleマップ対応</h3>
        <p>Googleマップの埋め込みで、お店へのアクセスが一目瞭然。集客につながります。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .service {
    padding: var(--section-padding);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .section-sub {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.3);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-icon svg {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
